### ScorePlay Media API — Request Examples
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or copy as curl commands.

### ===========================
### Tags
### ===========================

### Create a tag
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mbappé"
}

### Create another tag
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ligue 1"
}

### Create a third tag
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paris Saint-Germain"
}

### List all tags (default pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags

### List tags with custom pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags?limit=10&offset=0

### ===========================
### Media
### ===========================

### Upload a media file (replace TAG_ID_1 and TAG_ID_2 with actual UUIDs from tag creation)
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/media \
#   -F "name=Goal celebration" \
#   -F "tags=TAG_ID_1" \
#   -F "tags=TAG_ID_2" \
#   -F "file=@/path/to/photo.jpg"

### Retrieve a media by ID (replace MEDIA_ID with actual UUID)
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/media/MEDIA_ID

### ===========================
### Error cases (for testing)
### ===========================

### Create tag with empty name → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### Create tag with invalid JSON → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

not valid json

### Get media with invalid UUID → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/media/not-a-uuid

### Get non-existent media → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/media/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
